 do not pay for the program)","marks":1},{"criteria":"Customers can adapt the program / add features to it","marks":1}]},"maps":{"pdf-source":"data/pdf/j277/yearpapers/J27701_Computer_Systems_Practice_2019 (1).pdf","question-png":[["data/png/j277/yearpapers/paper-1-2019-practice/question/page-011.png"]],"markscheme-png":[["data/png/j277/yearpapers/paper-1-2019-practice/markscheme/page-023.png"]],"dev-qa":"e2e/screenshots/yearpapers/paper-1-2019-practice/dev-qa/q-7-c-i.png"}},{"question_id":"7(c)(ii)","parent_question":7,"topic":"proprietary licence benefits","marks":2,"command_word":"give","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Give two benefits to Eve of choosing a proprietary licence."}],"answer":{"guidance":"1 mark per bullet to max 2. Points: she can charge customers / earn a profit; she can restrict what users can do / users cannot edit it.","marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"Eve can charge customers / earn a profit from the program","marks":1},{"criteria":"Eve can restrict what users can do / users cannot edit or modify the program","marks":1}]},"maps":{"pdf-source":"data/pdf/j277/yearpapers/J27701_Computer_Systems_Practice_2019 (1).pdf","question-png":[["data/png/j277/yearpapers/paper-1-2019-practice/question/page-011.png"]],"markscheme-png":[["data/png/j277/yearpapers/paper-1-2019-practice/markscheme/page-023.png"]],"dev-qa":"e2e/screenshots/yearpapers/paper-1-2019-practice/dev-qa/q-7-c-ii.png"}},{"question_id":"7(d)(i)","parent_question":7,"topic":"cloud storage benefits","marks":3,"command_word":"describe","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Eve stores her computer program on the cloud whilst working on it."},{"type":"text","value":"Describe the benefits to Eve of storing the program on the cloud."}],"answer":{"guidance":[{"type":"text","value":"1 mark per bullet to max 3. Points:"},{"type":"list","items":["she can access the program from anywhere","so does not need to carry a storage device with her","security/backup is (likely) managed for her","so she does not 