ree correct binary codes in the correct order with no additional bits and no attempt to add them together. Accept the answer written vertically or horizontally. Benefit of the doubt for 7-bit ASCII codes if correct."}],"marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"At least one of the three characters (P, O, P) encoded correctly in ASCII (P = 01010000, O = 01001111)","marks":1},{"criteria":"All three characters encoded correctly in order: 01010000 01001111 01010000 (no extra bits, no attempt to add them together)","marks":1}]},"maps":{"pdf-source":"data/pdf/j277/yearpapers/J27701_Computer_systems_June_2025 (1).pdf","question-png":[["data/png/j277/yearpapers/paper-1-2025-june/question/page-013.png"]],"markscheme-png":[["data/png/j277/yearpapers/paper-1-2025-june/markscheme/page-031.png"]],"dev-qa":"e2e/screenshots/yearpapers/paper-1-2025-june/dev-qa/q-6-a.png"}},{"question_id":"6(b)","parent_question":6,"topic":"Unicode vs ASCII","marks":2,"command_word":"identify","content":[{"type":"text","value":"A new computer is being built."},{"type":"text","value":"Identify one benefit and one drawback of the computer using Unicode instead of ASCII."},{"type":"text","value":"Benefit: ____"},{"type":"text","value":"Drawback: ____"}],"answer":{"guidance":[{"type":"text","value":"1 mark for benefit, 1 mark for drawback. Award any correct point in the benefit or drawback box."},{"type":"text","value":"Benefit examples:"},{"type":"list","items":["can represent more / a wider range of characters","can represent characters from many/different languages (or by example)","can store emojis"]},{"type":"text","value":"Drawback examples:"},{"type":"list","items":["larger file size (double the file size of ASCII)","more data/binary per character","more storage/bits used","requires more processing","additional characters are not backward compatible with ASCII — some characters will not be recognised when documents are read/opened on computers that only have ASCII"]}],"marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"Benefit