xt","value":"Complete the function `moveCharacter()`"},{"type":"code","language":"ocr-reference","value":"function moveCharacter(direction, position)\\n\\n\\nendfunction"}],"answer":{"guidance":[{"type":"text","value":"1 mark each to max 6."},{"type":"list","items":["**BP1:** Appropriate use of both parameters and no additional inputs / incorrect overwrites that affect the outcome of the algorithm","**BP2:** Attempt at selection","**BP3:** Correctly checking if `direction` is \\"left\\" and subtracting 5 from `position` (or equivalent)","**BP4:** Correctly checking if `direction` is \\"right\\" and adding 5 to `position` (or equivalent)","**BP5:** Ensuring `position` is between 1 and 512 inclusive","**BP6:** Returning the updated `position`"]},{"type":"text","value":"Example solution:"},{"type":"code","value":"if direction == \\"left\\" then\\n    position = position - 5\\nelseif direction == \\"right\\" then\\n    position = position + 5\\nendif\\nif position < 1 then\\n    position = 1\\nelseif position > 512 then\\n    position = 512\\nendif\\nreturn position"},{"type":"text","value":"Acceptable variations:"},{"type":"list","items":["Allow `else` for BP3/BP4","Allow `<=`, `>=` and equivalents for BP5","Accept flowchart / structured English (must not just repeat the question)"]},{"type":"text","value":"Constraints:"},{"type":"list","items":["Do not award BP5 if it comes before BP3/BP4 (otherwise will alter `position` value)","BP6 only awarded if an attempt is made at calculating new `position`","For minor syntax errors (e.g. missing quotation marks, `==` for assignment, spaces in variable names) penalise once then follow-through"]}],"marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"Appropriate use of both parameters with no additional inputs / incorrect overwrites","marks":1},{"criteria":"Attempt at selection (if / select case)","marks":1},{"criteria":"Correctly checks if `direction` is \\"left\\" and subtracts 5 from `position`","marks":1},{"criteria":"Correctly checks if `directi