s cannot edit or modify the program","marks":1}]}},{"question_id":"7(d)(i)","parent_question":7,"topic":"cloud storage benefits","marks":3,"command_word":"describe","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Eve stores her computer program on the cloud whilst working on it."},{"type":"text","value":"Describe the benefits to Eve of storing the program on the cloud."}],"answer":{"guidance":"1 mark per bullet to max 3. Points: she can access the program from anywhere; so does not need to carry a storage device with her; security/backup is (likely) managed for her; so she does not need to manually backup her work.","marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"She can access the program from anywhere (with Internet access)","marks":1},{"criteria":"She does not need to carry a physical storage device with her","marks":1},{"criteria":"Security/backup is (likely) managed for her, so she does not need to manually back up her work","marks":1}]}},{"question_id":"7(d)(ii)","parent_question":7,"topic":"cloud storage drawbacks","marks":3,"command_word":"describe","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Describe the drawbacks to Eve of storing the program on the cloud."}],"answer":{"guidance":"1 mark per bullet to max 3. Points: if there is no Internet access she cannot access her work; transmission may not be secure; her work could be intercepted; security is out of her control; it may not be backed up / kept safe.","marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"If there is no Internet access she cannot access her work","marks":1},{"criteria":"Transmission may not be secure / her work could be intercepted in transit","marks":1},{"criteria":"Security is out of her control / data may not be backed up or kept safe by the provider","marks":1}]}}]`),sP={paper_id:KT,qualification:ZT,component:eP,title:tP,year:aP,session:rP,total_marks:nP,questions:iP},oP="J277-01-2022-June",cP="J277",lP="01",dP="Computer Systems",uP=2022,pP="June",hP=80,mP=JSON.parse(`[{"question_id":"1(a)","parent_question":1,"topic":"binary unit equivalents